      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have these issues without using any plugins while using my studio mic on Windows 11. It works fine everywhere else and Windows can detect the output just fine. The only way that I can fix this is by unpluggin and plugging my mic back in many many times. It sometimes only fixes it for a short while or I have to reboot my PC multiple times to get it back to work. It sometimes doesnt even work at all.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
